# Package manager: bun only (pinned via "packageManager" in package.json).
# bun.lock is the single source of truth and IS committed. Competing lockfiles
# are ignored so a stray `npm i` / `yarn` cannot reintroduce one — Vercel picks
# its package manager from whichever lockfile it finds, and a stale yarn.lock
# previously drifted 3 months behind package.json.
yarn.lock
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
bun.lockb
